{"about_the_game":"The Oneiroi (the gods of sleep) have descended onto the world. Everyone is asleep. It's up to you to try and save everyone from eternal slumber!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInspired by NES/Famicom classics, Dormant World is a retro platformer designed to look and feel like a game that could have existed 20 years ago. Dormant World is for you if you're a bit nostalgic about the good old days and want a &quot;game like old times, but new.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNot being overly long, the game is completable within two or three hours on a first playthrough and an hour on later replays.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDormant World Features:<br />\r\n- Controller support (NES/Famicom USB controller recommended)<br />\r\n- Toggleable retro filter to make the game look as if it's playing on an old TV<br />\r\n- Hardcore mode (no saves, no continues) for added challenge<br />\r\n- Level design featuring the four directions of the world and a compass to help you out<br />\r\n- Three levels guiding you through mountains, forests, and a desert<br />\r\n- A few puzzles to keep you on your toes<br />\r\n- Bosses at the end of each level","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"41f3d308644e0eeb76113248b00419d2755cf99d.jpg","localized_name":"Blabbermouth","name":"Blabbermouth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/671850/41f3d308644e0eeb76113248b00419d2755cf99d.jpg"},{"icon":"22f47a8743faffeda25e6a350be18a49fa661503.jpg","localized_name":"Healthy","name":"Healthy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/671850/22f47a8743faffeda25e6a350be18a49fa661503.jpg"},{"icon":"f92edec1798ad9abfcb11e96cbb7288c716a6276.jpg","localized_name":"Hydrated","name":"Hydrated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/671850/f92edec1798ad9abfcb11e96cbb7288c716a6276.jpg"},{"icon":"5976bdef81b97a5f4529422bf02a469ab5683584.jpg","localized_name":"The Monster","name":"The Monster","path":"https://c